WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.140
- Well, Suki and Riley, is it true

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.420
that you both went to band camp?

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.207
- Oh, we sure did.
- It's definitely true.

00:00:05.207 --> 00:00:06.040
Yes. (laughs)
(Riley laughs)

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.220
- So what, what was,
what was Band Camp like?

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.053
- It was love.

00:00:09.053 --> 00:00:10.920
- You sounded like you enjoyed it.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:11.753
- Yeah.

00:00:11.753 --> 00:00:12.586
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:12.586 --> 00:00:14.010
We did. We really enjoyed it.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.930
But it was, you know,
we worked really hard.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:16.800
- Yeah.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.050
- A lot of us had never done

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.670
the things we were doing on this show.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:21.630
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- I had never sang,

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:22.680
I'd never played guitar.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.380
Suki hadn't played, you
hadn't played the keys.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.910
You know, the other band
members had either never

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.573
played their instruments
or they hadn't in a while.

00:00:29.573 --> 00:00:30.420
- Mm.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.820
- We spent a lot of time
in that room together.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:33.720
- Do you do it now?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.040
Like obviously you do, but like

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.600
do you play now outside of it?

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:37.433
'Cause now, I don't know.

00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:38.460
I imagine when you learn something

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.740
as an actor, like I,
I, anything you learn,

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.000
I've talked to someone that learned how

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.170
they had to learn how to swim

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.220
to like, for their role or whatever.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.510
I'm like, do you keep that up?

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:49.411
- So I, I definitely like, feel
more confident singing now.

00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:50.244
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- So I'll, like

00:00:50.244 --> 00:00:52.140
if my husband sings for
example, I'll sing with him.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:52.973
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:52.973 --> 00:00:53.965
- More than I would have before.

00:00:53.965 --> 00:00:57.450
The songs I know are
just Daisy Jones songs.

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.776
- Yeah. (laughs)

00:00:58.776 --> 00:01:00.440
So I am amazing at those.
- I'm good at those

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.070
so like, I can play those.
- She's being humble.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.301
- She's got like one of the better voices

00:01:04.301 --> 00:01:06.300
I've ever heard in my-
- A stunning voice.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.160
- She belts in this show. She's really-

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.600
- Okay, you're also-
- You're really great.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:10.560
- by the way-
- And you have a-

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:11.552
- No, no.
- great voice as well.

00:01:11.552 --> 00:01:13.397
- By the way. She's got a
beautiful voice as well.

00:01:13.397 --> 00:01:14.240
- You guys, we're with like Kelly Clarkson

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.979
so we cannot talk about singing.

00:01:15.979 --> 00:01:17.970
- No, I love it.

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:20.019
I love - this is where you talk about it.

00:01:20.019 --> 00:01:21.681
I'm a singer. I love it.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:22.680
- And Camila does.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.420
- Well obviously we
know Suki is a rockstar,

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.250
but in this show, Riley has got,

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:27.450
I mean her voice, it's very,

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.290
it really does remind me of

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.060
like Stevie Nicks and
it has a Janice Joplin-

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.620
- [Kelly] Oh my God. That's cool.

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:32.530
- Joni Mitchell vibe.
- I mean,

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:34.580
- That is way overselling it.
- I think.

